lil' </span><span begin="02:41.457" end="02:41.699">skinny</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.769" end="02:46.123"><span begin="02:44.769" end="02:44.981">What </span><span begin="02:44.981" end="02:45.171">you </span><span begin="02:45.171" end="02:45.374">doin' </span><span begin="02:45.374" end="02:45.584">with </span><span begin="02:45.584" end="02:45.785">that </span><span begin="02:45.785" end="02:46.123">penis</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.344" end="02:47.975"><span begin="02:47.344" end="02:47.571">Who </span><span begin="02:47.571" end="02:47.774">did </span><span begin="02:47.774" end="02:47.975">that</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:50.330" end="02:53.418"><span begin="02:50.330" end="02:52.173">Huh </span><span begin="02:52.173" end="02:52.383">I'mma </span><span begin="02:52.383" end="02:52.597">tell </span><span begin="02:52.597" end="02:52.810">your </span><span begin="02:52.810" end="02:53.418">mama</span></p></div></body></tt>